    "vulnerabilities_to_exploit": [
      "Ko / Life-in-corner ambiguity: In the main line (1. B1 B2 2. A4 A1 3. A3), Black captures B1 at A1. What if Black plays 2... A1 immediately instead of B2 or A3?",
